cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TDM-READY, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "TDM-READY: Technical Debt Management Adoption Readiness Checklist"
abstract: >-
  A diagnostic instrument that assesses organizational readiness for adopting
  Technical Debt Management, that is, whether an organization meets the
  conditions the adoption requires. It comprises 21
  items across the People, Processes and Technology dimensions, and is
  applied in a collective, deliberative session. Developed under the Design
  Science Research approach as part of a master's dissertation at
  PPGI/UNIRIO. The instrument's content is written in Brazilian Portuguese.
